      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently, VRChat shows when a friend last logged in. This causes a problem when a friend doesn't have to reauthenticate for a couple days and shows up with an old last login timestamp while in fact the user has been online more recently than that. What we want instead is a last activity timestamp, the timestamp of the last instance ping to be precise.",
